			]
			title: "&cEnergy Core"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&eWyvern&r tier gear picks up upgrade modules - flight, auto-feed, shield capacity - turning your tools and armour into a build-your-own loadout."
				""
				"&e&lUpgrades are applied at a Fusion Crafting setup&r and each has multiple levels. You are not choosing a fixed item - you are spending resources to specialise it:"
				"&7- &fShield Capacity / Recovery&7 - a rechargeable damage buffer over your health"
				"&7- &fFlight&7 - creative-style flight once you reach the right tier"
				"&7- &fDig Speed / AOE&7 - the pickaxe mines 3x3, 5x5, and further"
				"&7- &fAuto-Feed&7 - eats from your inventory so you never starve mid-build"
				""
				"&e&lThe AOE upgrade is the one that changes your life.&r A Wyvern pickaxe on 5x5 clears platforms and terrain faster than any Builder card, and it works in every dimension without setup."
				""
				"&c&lEverything here runs on stored FE.&r Flat gear is ordinary gear - the shield stops, the flight stops, and you fall. Keep a charged Energy Cube or a wireless crystal on you."
				""
				"&7Configure active upgrades with the module GUI keybind rather than re-crafting. Most upgrades can be toggled on the fly.&r"
			]
